WEBVTT

00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:13,750
Any thoughts on using the rife in the greenhouse for plant growth?

00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:21,630
Well, yeah, I've thought about all sorts of things on benefits of using frequencies in other things.

00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:35,170
And I've actually talked to a we had a patient a long time ago that did this and swore that their greenhouse plants grew better.

00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:42,930
I don't know how you would, you know, be able to keep a controlled environment to run an experiment on this.

00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:46,610
But those kind of things interest me greatly.

00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:53,970
I've just never taken the time to try to do a controlled experiment with something like this.

00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:55,970
There's a lot of factors that go into that.

00:00:56,770 --> 00:01:02,530
But yeah, if you do that, let us know the results.

